{
  "id": "personal-protective-equipment",
  "term": "personal protective equipment",
  "definition": "Personal protective equipment is special clothing or gear used to protect a worker from occupational health risks when other hazard-control measures are not enough or cannot be used. It includes items such as helmets, masks, gloves, eye protection, boots, ear plugs, high-visibility clothing, and safety harnesses.",
